    <div style="font-size:12px">
        <p>
            <b>Account and Opportunity</b> content <u>including all notes and attachments</u> in Salesforce are only approved
            for information classified <u><b>Intel Confidential</b></u>.  Please use Inside Blue groups to store account and
            opportunity content classified Intel Restricted Secret or higher.
        </p>
        <p>
            Remember documents are classified at the highest classification level of content in the presentation.
        </p>
        <p>
            Controlled Technology may <b>not</b> be placed in Salesforce.
        </p>
        <p>
            <b>Intel Premier Support (IPS)</b><br/>
            (Please note IPS in Salesforce is <b>NOT</b> approved for Controlled Technology nor Intel Top Secret Information)<br/>
            For IPS Case Management, Intel Restricted Secret content, which is NOT controlled technology, may be included only
            in the following places, because it is encrypted by the system: 
            <ul>
                <li>Case Subject</li>
                <li>Case Description</li>
                <li>Case Comments</li>
                <li>Case Closure Comment</li>
                <li>Case Resolution Reason</li>
                <li>Case File Name</li>
                <li>Case File Description</li>
                <li>IPS case attachments and IPS file uploads may include Intel Restricted Secret if the proper agreements are
                    in place and the data does not include controlled technology. The uploads and attachments for IPS are stored
                    on premise in a secure file database and shared through Secure File Transfer</li>
            </ul>
        </p>
    </div>
